{
  "_comment": "環境の役割。起動: claude --settings .claude/settings.env.json  (alias: cc-env)。書けるのは環境の範囲と docs。Assets の機能コードは環境の変更に必要な最小限だけ(hook がメンテナが書くファイルを止める)。",
  "env": {
    "YURECHECK_ROLE": "env"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Write(./AGENTS.md)",
      "Edit(./AGENTS.md)",
      "Write(./.claude/**)",
      "Edit(./.claude/**)",
      "Write(./.github/**)",
      "Edit(./.github/**)",
      "Write(./tools/**)",
      "Edit(./tools/**)",
      "Write(./docs/**)",
      "Edit(./docs/**)",
      "Write(./Packages/manifest.json)",
      "Edit(./Packages/manifest.json)",
      "Bash(uv run tools/status.py:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Write(./core/Yurecheck.Core/Judge/**)",
      "Edit(./core/Yurecheck.Core/Judge/**)",
      "Write(./core/Yurecheck.Core/Measure/*Reference*.cs)",
      "Edit(./core/Yurecheck.Core/Measure/*Reference*.cs)",
      "Write(./core/Yurecheck.Core/Judge/*.cs)",
      "Edit(./core/Yurecheck.Core/Judge/*.cs)",
      "Write(./docs/OWNER_WRITTEN.md)",
      "Edit(./docs/OWNER_WRITTEN.md)",
      "Write(./docs/METRICS.md)",
      "Edit(./docs/METRICS.md)",
      "Write(./Assets/Yurecheck/Runtime/Stepper.cs)",
      "Edit(./Assets/Yurecheck/Runtime/Stepper.cs)",
      "Write(./Assets/Yurecheck/Runtime/Sdf/Sign*.cs)",
      "Edit(./Assets/Yurecheck/Runtime/Sdf/Sign*.cs)",
      "Write(./scenarios/thresholds.json)",
      "Edit(./scenarios/thresholds.json)"
    ]
  },
  "_proposal": "案(メンテナの判断待ち): 環境の作業は定型が多いので effortLevel を medium、model は一段安いものでも足りる見込み。決まったら \"model\" と \"effortLevel\" をここに足す。使ったモデルは hook が transcript から記録する。"
}
